= Variable
{synonym}

A <variable> is a symbol that represents an element whose value may vary or remain unspecified.

= Constant
{disambiguate=mathematics}
{parent=Mathematics}
{wiki}

= Constant
{synonym}

A <constant> is a fixed value within the problem or model under discussion.

= Constant of proportionality
{title2=$k$}
{parent=Mathematics}

If two <variable>s satisfy $y=kx$ for a fixed <constant> $k$, then $k$ is their <constant of proportionality>.

